    <h1 style="font-size: 38px; margin-bottom: 8px; color: #ffffff;">Cancellation & Refund Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: var(--primary-blue); letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px;">
      Flutter Hotels & Resorts — Clear & Transparent Cancellation Rules
    </p>
