<section class="section-padding" style="background: #f8fafc;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px; background: #ffffff; padding: 40px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
    
    <div style="margin-bottom: 25px; padding-bottom: 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #f1f5f9;">
      <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b;">Last Updated: August 18, 2026 | Compliant with Online Payment Gateway Guidelines</p>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">1. Standard Cancellation Policy</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      We understand that travel plans can change. Cancellations for bookings at <strong>Flutter Hotels & Resorts</strong>, Lansdowne, are governed by the following timelines:
    </p>
    
    <div style="background: #f1f5f9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 25px; border-left: 4px solid var(--primary-blue);">
      <ul style="color: #334155; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0; padding-left: 15px;">
        <li><strong>48 Hours or More Prior to Check-in:</strong> 100% Full Refund (Minus 3% gateway processing fee if applicable).</li>
        <li><strong>Between 24 Hours and 48 Hours Prior to Check-in:</strong> 50% Refund of the total booking amount.</li>
        <li><strong>Less Than 24 Hours Prior to Check-in or No-Show:</strong> 0% Refund (100% cancellation charge applies).</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">2. Peak Season & Special Package Cancellations</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      For stays during Peak Festive Seasons (Diwali, Christmas, New Year Eve, Long Weekends, Group Departures & Destination Weddings), cancellations made less than 7 days prior to check-in date are non-refundable. Dates can be modified subject to availability and management approval.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">3. Refund Processing & Timelines</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 15px;">
      How refunds are executed:
    </p>
    <ul style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li><strong>Original Payment Method:</strong> All eligible refunds are automatically credited back to the original source payment account (Credit Card, Debit Card, NetBanking, UPI, or Wallet) used during online checkout via Razorpay gateway.</li>
      <li><strong>Processing Timeframe:</strong> Once approved, refunds are initiated within 24 hours and credited to your bank/card account within <strong>5 to 7 working days</strong>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">4. How to Request Cancellation</h2>
    <p style="color: #475569; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 25px;">
      To cancel or modify your reservation, please email us with your Booking ID at <a href="mailto:sales@flutterhotel.com" style="color: var(--primary-blue); font-weight: bold;">sales@flutterhotel.com</a> or call/WhatsApp our reservations desk at <a href="tel:+918929232740" style="color: var(--primary-blue); font-weight: bold;">+91 89 2923 2740</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 22px; color: var(--dark-bg); margin-bottom: 12px;">5. Hotel Contact Details</h2>
